  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Tabernacle",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Make the tabernacle with ten curtains of finely twisted linen and blue, purple and scarlet yarn, with cherubim woven into them by a skilled worker.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the curtains are to be the same size—twenty-eight cubits long and four cubits wide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Join five of the curtains together, and do the same with the other five.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make loops of blue material along the edge of the end curtain in one set, and do the same with the end curtain in the other set.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make fifty loops on one curtain and fifty loops on the end curtain of the other set, with the loops opposite each other.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then make fifty gold clasps and use them to fasten the curtains together so that the tabernacle is a unit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Make curtains of goat hair for the tent over the tabernacle—eleven altogether.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All eleven curtains are to be the same size—thirty cubits long and four cubits wide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Join five of the curtains together into one set and the other six into another set. Fold the sixth curtain double at the front of the tent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make fifty loops along the edge of the end curtain in one set and also along the edge of the end curtain in the other set.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then make fifty bronze clasps and put them in the loops to fasten the tent together as a unit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for the additional length of the tent curtains, the half curtain that is left over is to hang down at the rear of the tabernacle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tent curtains will be a cubit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "longer on both sides; what is left will hang over the sides of the tabernacle so as to cover it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make for the tent a covering of ram skins dyed red, and over that a covering of the other durable leather.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Make upright frames of acacia wood for the tabernacle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each frame is to be ten cubits long and a cubit and a half wide,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with two projections set parallel to each other. Make all the frames of the tabernacle in this way.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make twenty frames for the south side of the tabernacle",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and make forty silver bases to go under them—two bases for each frame, one under each projection.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the other side, the north side of the tabernacle, make twenty frames",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and forty silver bases—two under each frame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make six frames for the far end, that is, the west end of the tabernacle,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and make two frames for the corners at the far end.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At these two corners they must be double from the bottom all the way to the top and fitted into a single ring; both shall be like that.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So there will be eight frames and sixteen silver bases—two under each frame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Also make crossbars of acacia wood: five for the frames on one side of the tabernacle,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "five for those on the other side, and five for the frames on the west, at the far end of the tabernacle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The center crossbar is to extend from end to end at the middle of the frames.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Overlay the frames with gold and make gold rings to hold the crossbars. Also overlay the crossbars with gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Set up the tabernacle according to the plan shown you on the mountain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Make a curtain of blue, purple and scarlet yarn and finely twisted linen, with cherubim woven into it by a skilled worker.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hang it with gold hooks on four posts of acacia wood overlaid with gold and standing on four silver bases.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hang the curtain from the clasps and place the ark of the covenant law behind the curtain. The curtain will separate the Holy Place from the Most Holy Place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put the atonement cover on the ark of the covenant law in the Most Holy Place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Place the table outside the curtain on the north side of the tabernacle and put the lampstand opposite it on the south side.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
